    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this fine 3 bedroom period townhouse in the heart of Howth village that has been, extended, renovated and modernised while maintaining period charm. Presented in excellent condition throughout. Gas fired central heating (with new combi-boiler) and double glazed windows. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, livingroom, 3rd bedroom, open plan kitchen / dining room, and upstairs there are 2 more bedrooms, study and family shower room.\n\nLocation is excellent. Set right in the very heart of the beautiful Howth village. With a whole host of local amenities on your very doorstep including schools, shops, church, bars & restaurants. Range of sports & leisure facilities. Public transport is well catered for with bus & DART to&from Dublin City Centre. There is great coastal walk & cycleway too. Dublin Airport is close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nTimber floor, alarm control panel\n\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 3.75m\nCast-iron open fire, timber floor, sash window, built-in cabinets and display shelving, wall pannelling, TV point\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.70m x 4.85m\nFitted kitchen, marble countertops, oven, hob, extractor, belfast sink, intergrated dishwasher and fridge freezer, plumbed for washing room, tiled floor, recess lights, glass door out to rear garden\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.90m x 3.8m\nTimber floor, ornate fireplace, sash window\n\nLanding - \nHot press\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.55m x 4.00m\nTongue & grooved timber floor, ornate fireplace, 2 sash windows\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.30m x 3.90m\nTongue & grooved timber floor, ornate fireplace, sash window, pull down ladder to attic\n\nStudy - 2.30m x 4.00m\nTongue & grooved timber floor, spot light, velux window, built-in cabinet\n\nShower room - 2.25m x 2.45m\nWHB with cabinet, WC, bidet, shower, fully tiled, recess lights\n\nOutside - Rear Garden\nWalled, paved patio, artifical lawn, outdoor light, outdoor tap, awning\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Heart of Howth village</li><li>GFCH (New combi boiler)</li><li>Double glazed windows (sash to front)</li><li>Alarm</li><li>Private 'Courtyard Style' rear garden</li><li>Nice kitchen</li><li>Modern family shower room</li><li>Period features inc. sash windows to front & cast iron fireplaces.</li><li>On-street parking</li><li>Approx 110 sqm/ 1,184sqft</ul>"
      },
      {
